<title>SWEDEN: Swedish retail sales rose 2.1 pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>Swedish retail sales rose 2.1 pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail sales rose 2.1 percent in September, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    (Percentage change)	   Sept 96     year to date</p>
<p>    Retail sales		    +2.1	 unchanged</p>
<p>    - in non-specialised stores +2.9	 n/a</p>
<p>    - in specialised stores     +2.3	 n/a</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46 8 7001017</p>
